  "derivation": "On N-1 uniform qubits mark weights k-1,k, with p=C(N,k)/2^(N-1). For p>=1/4 choose phi=acos(1-1/(2p)). Apply the marked-subspace phase exp(i phi), then I+(exp(i phi)-1)|s><s|. Every unmarked amplitude vanishes. Append k XOR parity into a fresh qubit to obtain D(N,k).",
